IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-H2O-EVICTION.

DATA DIVISION.
01 TOTAL-TOKENS        PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 BUDGET-H2O          PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 RETAINED-TOKENS     PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 EVICTED-TOKENS      PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.
01 REDUCTION-PCT       PIC 9(9) USAGE R4.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-H2O.
    IF TOTAL-TOKENS == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    IF BUDGET-H2O < TOTAL-TOKENS
        MOVE BUDGET-H2O TO RETAINED-TOKENS.
    ELSE
        MOVE TOTAL-TOKENS TO RETAINED-TOKENS.
    END-IF.

    COMPUTE EVICTED-TOKENS = TOTAL-TOKENS - RETAINED-TOKENS.
    COMPUTE REDUCTION-PCT = (EVICTED-TOKENS * 100) / TOTAL-TOKENS.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 REDUCTION-PCT.
    WEIGHT 30 RETAINED-TOKENS.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 20.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
